---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy" description="How Listika uses data and how to manage your analytics choice.">
  <div class="wrap prose-layout">
    <div class="index-line"><span><a href="/">THE INDEX</a> / PRIVACY</span><span>LISTIKA</span></div>
    <p class="eyebrow">SITE INFORMATION / 03</p>
    <h1>Privacy.</h1>
    <div class="prose">
      <p class="opening">This notice explains the services used on Listika and the choices available to you.</p>
      <h2>Hosting and security</h2>
      <p>Listika is a static website hosted by GitHub Pages. GitHub logs and stores visitors’ IP addresses for security and may process technical request information to deliver its service. See <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/pages/getting-started-with-github-pages/what-is-github-pages">GitHub Pages documentation</a> and <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement">GitHub’s privacy statement</a>. Listika has no visitor accounts or forms.</p>
      <h2>Google Analytics</h2>
      <p>With your permission, Listika uses Google Analytics to understand how visitors use the site. It may use first-party cookies and collect pages viewed, interactions such as scrolls and outbound clicks, browser and device details, and approximate location. Google processes this information to provide reports. Read about <a href="https://support.google.com/analytics/answer/6004245">Google Analytics and data privacy</a> and <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites">how Google uses information from sites using its services</a>.</p>
      <p>Analytics does not load before you allow it, if you reject it, or while your browser sends a Global Privacy Control signal. You can change your choice at any time using <strong>Privacy settings</strong> in the footer. Your choice is stored in this browser for up to 180 days, unless you clear it sooner. You may need to choose again on another device or browser. Withdrawing your choice stops future Analytics collection from this site; it does not automatically erase data already collected.</p>
      <p>You can also manage cookies in your browser or use <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout">Google’s Analytics opt-out browser add-on</a> where supported.</p>
      <h2>Search Console and AdSense</h2>
      <p>We use Google Search Console to understand how Listika pages appear in Google Search; this does not itself add a visitor-tracking script to the site.</p>
      <p>Listika has been submitted for Google AdSense review. The site includes an ownership-verification marker and ads.txt file; it does not currently load the AdSense advertising script or serve AdSense ads. We will update this notice and the available choices before enabling advertising.</p>
      <h2>Your privacy rights</h2>
      <p>Depending on your location and the applicable law, you may have rights to access, correct, delete or obtain a copy of personal information, restrict or object to processing, withdraw consent, or opt out of certain sharing or targeted advertising. These rights can have conditions and exceptions. You may also be able to complain to a data-protection authority, such as the <a href="https://ico.org.uk/">UK Information Commissioner’s Office</a>.</p>
      <p>For privacy questions or to make a request, email <a href="mailto:listika-com@googlegroups.com">listika-com@googlegroups.com</a>. If your request is declined, you can also use this address to ask us to reconsider. We may need information to verify a request, but Analytics data may not be identifiable to a particular person without additional information.</p>
      <h2>Other sites and changes</h2>
      <p>Our lists link to other websites and map services. Their own privacy practices apply when you follow those links. We will update this notice when our services or data practices change.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
